<edge source="El40" target="Csa/Ansi B22734:2023">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The EL40 conforms to the CSA/ANSI B22734:2023 Ed.1 standard for Hydrogen Generators Using Water Electrolysis covering industrial, commercial, and residential applications.</data>
  <data key="d9">safety certification,standards compliance</data>
